      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like every time i try to help things just get harder. they look at me and i can just see them worrying about me or feeling like they have to pick up my slack. it would be so much easier for them if they didn't have to deal with my mess and my failures. i just want them to have a life that isn't so weighed down by me.",
